  _promptUI: {fileID: 2086633189611502466}
  dialogue: {fileID: 0}
  firstDialogueLines:
  - ' Welcome, traveler...'
  - This is the resting ground of lost souls.
  - Only the brave have what it takes to watch over this place...
  - Hehe I'm just joking man.
  - You must be the new hire. Welcome to Ashvale Cemetery.
  - Right beside me is Wick. He assists the graveyard workers.
  - Go to talk to him.
  - If you ever need something DON'T go to  me.
  altDialogueLines:
  - Wachuwant I told you do not disturb
